# Install as /usr/lib/tmpfiles.d/agentcapsule-authority.conf (systemd-tmpfiles).
# The authority service's sockets, created at boot, before the service, the
# worker or the API starts. The set-group-ID bit gives the sockets the group
# agentcapsule-authority-clients: worker.sock is mode 0660 for the worker's
# account (worker_uid, a member of that group, ADR 024), or 0600 (root only)
# without it; api.sock 0660 (the API's account, a member of that group).
d /run/agentcapsule-authority 2750 agentcapsule-authority agentcapsule-authority-clients -
# The authority and worker accounts traverse the runtime root's parent during
# upgrades and operation. Only root can list it (ADR 024).
d /var/lib/agentcapsule 0711 root root -
